            "summary": "The #insrc-newchat chrome button, its CSS, click wiring (stopPropagation + newChatPick(nc)), and the row-less renderHistoryMenu all land in commit f636a30c0 exactly as specified by LLD-e0821209d94791d0-s1 (the pinned commit b0ef7d8d9a is an artifact-checkin chore with no further changes to chat-panel.ts). newChatPick's existing closePops()+focus()+postMessage body is untouched, so the new-chat payload stays byte-identical and ac1-ac5 are each satisfied by the updated pinning tests in chat-panel.test.ts and chat-shell.test.ts, which were inspected and correctly assert button placement left of .histchip, the inline bubble-plus SVG, the row-less menu, and single-post click wiring.",
